OL,3,GNEWSABat detectorist concerned by
OL,4,Adecline in numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bat detectorist from Seaham is
OL,7,Fconcerned the bat population in his
OL,8,Farea is declining year on year.
OL,10,FPassionate conservationist Desmond
OL,11,FConsitt first began using a bat
OL,12,Fdetector 15 years ago, using the device
OL,13,Fto listen to the mammals' unique,
OL,14,Fhigh-frequency clicking sounds and
OL,15,Frecord them as they fly around in the
OL,16,Fdark.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
