OL,3,GNEWSABat detectorist concerned by
OL,4,Adecline in numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe describes the experience as
OL,7,Ftransformative: "It is like watching a
OL,8,Fblack and white picture - as soon as
OL,9,Fyou put the bat detector on and you can
OL,10,Fhear them, it becomes a colour
OL,11,Fpicture."
OL,13,FBut he warned: "You used to see more
OL,14,Fbats in Seaham than now, but I don't
OL,15,Fknow why that is."
